  "sections": [
    {
      "key": "quickFacts",
      "source": "planetcatfish",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.planetcatfish.com/common/species.php?species_id=1083",
      "html": "<p>Otocinclus affinis Steindachner, 1877. Size: 5 cm SL. Mainly nocturnal.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "beforeYouBuy",
      "source": "planetcatfish",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.planetcatfish.com/common/species.php?species_id=1083",
      "html": "<p>Otocinclus affinis is a rare import from Brazil. It is almost universally misidentified in hobby literature, with the correct determination often being O. vittatus, which is very commonly imported and offered for sale.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "distribution",
      "source": "planetcatfish",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.planetcatfish.com/common/species.php?species_id=1083",
      "html": "<p>South America: vicinity of Rio de Janeiro, Brazil. Type locality: streams at Santa Cruz in the region of Rio de Janeiro.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "waterConditions",
      "source": "planetcatfish",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.planetcatfish.com/common/species.php?species_id=1083",
      "html": "<ul><li>pH: 6.0 - 8.0</li><li>Temperature: 20.0-26.0°C</li><li>dH: 5-19</li></ul>"
    },
    {
      "key": "diet",
      "source": "planetcatfish",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.planetcatfish.com/common/species.php?species_id=1083",
      "html": "<p>Feeds on algae, in particular on leaves and roots of plants.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "behaviour",
      "source": "planetcatfish",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.planetcatfish.com/common/species.php?species_id=1083",
      "html": "<p>Keep in groups (preferably at least six) with any small to mid-sized community fish.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "dimorphism",
      "source": "planetcatfish",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.planetcatfish.com/common/species.php?species_id=1083",
      "html": "<p>Females are larger and broader, especially when viewed from above.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "reproduction",
      "source": "planetcatfish",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.planetcatfish.com/common/species.php?species_id=1083",
      "html": "<p>Unreported. There is no breeding report.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "notes",
      "source": "planetcatfish",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.planetcatfish.com/common/species.php?species_id=1083",
      "html": "<p>Etymology: Greek, ous, oto = ear + Latin, cinclus = latticework; in allusion to the holes of the head in the ears.</p>"
    },
    {
